{"id":"954547d789193344","group":"91","path":"91/91-lem-soundness-consistency-relation.md","title":"算术可靠性严格强于一致性","display":"lem-soundness-consistency-relation — 算术可靠性严格强于一致性","type":"lemma","metadata":{"type":"lemma","book":"Axiomatic Theories of Truth","book_abbrev":"91","label":"91-lem-soundness-consistency-relation","aliases":["91-lem-soundness-consistency-relation","91-lem-sound-consistency","91-lem-soundness-con"],"display":"lem-soundness-consistency-relation — 算术可靠性严格强于一致性","depends_on":["[[91-df-soundness-predicate]]","[[91-df-consistency-predicate]]"]},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"lemma"},{"key":"book","html":"Axiomatic Theories of Truth"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"91"},{"key":"label","html":"91-lem-soundness-consistency-relation"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>91-lem-soundness-consistency-relation</span><span>91-lem-sound-consistency</span><span>91-lem-soundness-con</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"lem-soundness-consistency-relation — 算术可靠性严格强于一致性"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"acda8ebf92673c3d\" href=\"?note=acda8ebf92673c3d\" title=\"91-df-soundness-predicate\">91-df-soundness-predicate</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"4e50c115b0d32044\" href=\"?note=4e50c115b0d32044\" title=\"91-df-consistency-predicate\">91-df-consistency-predicate</a></span></div>"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{ArSound}(\\mathcal T)\\coloneqq\n\\forall\\varphi\\in\\mathrm{Sent}_{\\mathcal L_0}\\,\n(\\mathcal T\\vdash\\varphi\\Rightarrow\\mathbb N\\models\\varphi)\">\\(\\operatorname{ArSound}(\\mathcal T)\\coloneqq\n\\forall\\varphi\\in\\mathrm{Sent}_{\\mathcal L_0}\\,\n(\\mathcal T\\vdash\\varphi\\Rightarrow\\mathbb N\\models\\varphi)\\)</span>\n(<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathcal T\">\\(\\mathcal T\\)</span> 的外部算术可靠性)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{Con}(\\mathcal T)\">\\(\\operatorname{Con}(\\mathcal T)\\)</span> (<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathcal T\">\\(\\mathcal T\\)</span> 不证明固定矛盾句)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{PA}\">\\(\\mathrm{PA}\\)</span> (满足第二不完备定理条件的 Peano 算术)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{Con}(\\mathrm{PA})\">\\(\\operatorname{Con}(\\mathrm{PA})\\)</span> (PA 一致)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{PA}\\nvdash\\operatorname{Con}(\\mathrm{PA})\">\\(\\mathrm{PA}\\nvdash\\operatorname{Con}(\\mathrm{PA})\\)</span> (第二不完备性结论)</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{lem\\text{-}soundness\\text{-}consistency\\text{-}relation}\\vdash\n\\operatorname{ArSound}(\\mathcal T)\n\\to\n\\operatorname{Con}(\\mathcal T)\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{lem\\text{-}soundness\\text{-}consistency\\text{-}relation}\\vdash\n\\operatorname{ArSound}(\\mathcal T)\n\\to\n\\operatorname{Con}(\\mathcal T)\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><p>以及</p>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\left[\n\\operatorname{Con}(\\mathrm{PA})\n\\land\n\\mathrm{PA}\\nvdash\\operatorname{Con}(\\mathrm{PA})\n\\right]\n\\to\n\\left[\n\\operatorname{Con}\\bigl(\\mathrm{PA}+\\neg\\operatorname{Con}(\\mathrm{PA})\\bigr)\n\\land\n\\neg\\operatorname{ArSound}\\bigl(\\mathrm{PA}+\\neg\\operatorname{Con}(\\mathrm{PA})\\bigr)\n\\right].\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\left[\n\\operatorname{Con}(\\mathrm{PA})\n\\land\n\\mathrm{PA}\\nvdash\\operatorname{Con}(\\mathrm{PA})\n\\right]\n\\to\n\\left[\n\\operatorname{Con}\\bigl(\\mathrm{PA}+\\neg\\operatorname{Con}(\\mathrm{PA})\\bigr)\n\\land\n\\neg\\operatorname{ArSound}\\bigl(\\mathrm{PA}+\\neg\\operatorname{Con}(\\mathrm{PA})\\bigr)\n\\right].\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<p>若理论可靠，它不能证明在标准模型中为假的矛盾句，所以必一致。反向\n不成立：若 PA 一致且不能证明自身一致性，则\n<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{PA}+\\neg\\operatorname{Con}(\\mathrm{PA})\">\\(\\mathrm{PA}+\\neg\\operatorname{Con}(\\mathrm{PA})\\)</span> 一致；但附加公理在\n标准模型中为假，故该扩张不可靠。</p>\n<p>例子依赖 PA 的标准可递归公理化与第二不完备性条件。它说明的是外部\n语义可靠性和句法一致性的差别，不授权对 KF、FS 等具体理论填入未经\n证明的“可证声性”表格。</p>\n<p>这里的 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{ArSound}\">\\(\\operatorname{ArSound}\\)</span> 是元层语义性质；它不同于\n<a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-3\" data-note=\"acda8ebf92673c3d\" href=\"?note=acda8ebf92673c3d\" title=\"91-df-soundness-predicate\">91-df-soundness-predicate</a> 中用对象语言真理谓词表达的\n<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Sound}_T(\\mathcal T)\">\\(\\mathrm{Sound}_T(\\mathcal T)\\)</span>。</p>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"91-df-soundness-predicate","status":"resolved","id":"acda8ebf92673c3d","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[91-df-soundness-predicate]]","embed":false},{"target":"91-df-consistency-predicate","status":"resolved","id":"4e50c115b0d32044","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[91-df-consistency-predicate]]","embed":false},{"target":"91-df-soundness-predicate","status":"resolved","id":"acda8ebf92673c3d","anchor":"ref-3","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Remark]","excerpt":"这里的 $\\operatorname{ArSound}$ 是元层语义性质；它不同于\n[[91-df-soundness-predicate]] 中用对象语言真理谓词表达的\n$\\mathrm{Sound}_T(\\mathcal T)$。","embed":false}],"math":[{"tex":"\\operatorname{ArSound}(\\mathcal T)\\coloneqq\n\\forall\\varphi\\in\\mathrm{Sent}_{\\mathcal L_0}\\,\n(\\mathcal T\\vdash\\varphi\\Rightarrow\\mathbb N\\models\\varphi)","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathcal T","display":false},{"tex":"\\operatorname{Con}(\\mathcal T)","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathcal T","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{PA}","display":false},{"tex":"\\operatorname{Con}(\\mathrm{PA})","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{PA}\\nvdash\\operatorname{Con}(\\mathrm{PA})","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{lem\\text{-}soundness\\text{-}consistency\\text{-}relation}\\vdash\n\\operatorname{ArSound}(\\mathcal T)\n\\to\n\\operatorname{Con}(\\mathcal T)","display":true},{"tex":"\\left[\n\\operatorname{Con}(\\mathrm{PA})\n\\land\n\\mathrm{PA}\\nvdash\\operatorname{Con}(\\mathrm{PA})\n\\right]\n\\to\n\\left[\n\\operatorname{Con}\\bigl(\\mathrm{PA}+\\neg\\operatorname{Con}(\\mathrm{PA})\\bigr)\n\\land\n\\neg\\operatorname{ArSound}\\bigl(\\mathrm{PA}+\\neg\\operatorname{Con}(\\mathrm{PA})\\bigr)\n\\right].","display":true},{"tex":"\\mathrm{PA}+\\neg\\operatorname{Con}(\\mathrm{PA})","display":false},{"tex":"\\operatorname{ArSound}","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{Sound}_T(\\mathcal T)","display":false}],"bytes":2139,"backlinks":[],"outgoing":["acda8ebf92673c3d","4e50c115b0d32044"]}